================================================================================
Map Script for londonmonitorbosstest.map
================================================================================
*/

/*================================================================================
LONDON MONITOR 

                                        Pos 0
                                        Fw+L
                                         ^
                                         |
                                      +  |  ^
                                      |  |  |
                               Anim 2 |  |  | Anim 0
                                      |  |  |
                                      |  |  |
                            Anim 3    v  |  +     Anim 3
                          <----------+   |   <----------+
             Pos 3                        
             Bw+L   <------------------- 5 ------------------->  Pos 1
                                                                 Fw+R
                          +---------->   |   +---------->
                            Anim 1    +  |  ^     Anim 1
                                      |  |  |
                                      |  |  |
                               Anim 2 |  |  | Anim 0
                                      |  |  |
                                      v  |  +
                                         v
                                       Pos 2
                                       Bw+R

================================================================================*/
